1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:03,630
(Penny:)So, what's the deal
with your apartment?

2
00:00:03,627 --> 00:00:05,227
(Penny:)Why's it taking so long?

3
00:00:05,228 --> 00:00:08,298
(Amy:)Um, it was a drywall problem.

4
00:00:08,298 --> 00:00:11,768
(Penny:)Oh, no, what happened?

5
00:00:11,768 --> 00:00:16,668
(Amy:)Well, the drywall got wet,
and you do not want wet drywall

6
00:00:16,673 --> 00:00:20,773
(Amy:)because when drywall gets
wet, it's really more...

7
00:00:20,777 --> 00:00:23,607
(Penny:)Wet wall?

8
00:00:23,613 --> 00:00:27,413
(Amy:)Or damp wall, just as bad.
Mm.

9
00:00:27,417 --> 00:00:30,657
(Penny:)So why don't they
just get more drywall?

10
00:00:30,654 --> 00:00:33,384
(Amy:)Well, they went to get some,

11
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:37,690
(Amy:)but the woman at the wall store

12
00:00:37,694 --> 00:00:39,364
(Amy:)said it was going on sale
and they should wait

13
00:00:39,362 --> 00:00:42,332
(Amy:)because the savings...
Okay, are you done?

14
00:00:42,332 --> 00:00:44,062
(Penny:)Bernadette told me
your apartment's ready.

15
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:48,037
(Amy:)I was done at wet wall,
but you wouldn't let it go.

16
00:00:48,038 --> 00:00:50,908
(Penny:)But is Sheldon really
believing all this crap?

17
00:00:50,907 --> 00:00:53,677
(Amy:)Well, he started to question it,
but then I fake sneezed on him

18
00:00:53,677 --> 00:00:56,677
(Amy:)and he ran to take a shower.

19
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:59,450
(Amy:)Please don't say anything,
I feel terrible about this.

